## 1. Current State Gap Analysis

### What Exists Today

| Layer | File | Status |
|-------|------|--------|
| **Schema** | `challenges` + `challenge_enrollments` | Basic fields: name, profit target, daily loss, duration, status |
| **Admin UI** | [ScoutWorkbench.tsx](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/components/admin/ScoutWorkbench.tsx) Challenges tab | Simple create form + flat table |
| **Trader UI** | [LeaderboardScreen.tsx](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/client/src/pages/LeaderboardScreen.tsx) Compete tab | Flat table with Enroll/Withdraw |
| **API** | [adminScout.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/adminScout.ts) + [traderTalent.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/traderTalent.ts) | Basic CRUD + enroll/withdraw/status |
| **Engine** | [engines.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/recruitment/engines.ts) + [evaluateChallenges.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/cron/evaluateChallenges.ts) | Single-pass PASS/FAIL evaluation |
| **Notifications** | [messaging.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/services/messaging.ts) + [notifications.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/notifications.ts) | [createNotification()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/services/messaging.ts#1177-1285) with E2EE, `publishLiveEvent()` for real-time, types: TRADE/SYSTEM/ACCOUNT/SECURITY/KYC |
| **Mailbox** | [mailbox.ts](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/routes/mailbox.ts) | Compose/reply/broadcast with rate limiting, E2EE envelopes, Zod validation |

### Critical Gaps

| Gap | Impact |
|-----|--------|
| No multi-phase challenges | Cannot model 1/2/3-phase evaluations |
| No capital base snapshot | PnL uses all-time trades, not challenge window |
| No admin configurability for rewards | No prize pools, badges, or certificates |
| No challenge notification type | Existing [createNotification()](file://wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/bcodex/TD.2.ANTIGRAVITY/server/services/messaging.ts#1177-1285) lacks `CHALLENGE` type |
| No enrollment management UI | Admin cannot view/override individual enrollments |
| No challenge leaderboard | No competitive ranking |
| No consistency rules | No max single-day profit cap |
| No drawdown type selection (static/trailing) | Cannot customize per challenge |
| No retry rules or tracking | Unlimited retries |
| No analytics dashboard | No pass/fail rates, trends |
| No security hardening specific to challenges | No injection prevention, transport security for challenge data |

